WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.241
Count the shaded pieces in a whole cut into 4 equal parts. What do we call 1 shaded

00:00:06.241 --> 00:00:10.940
piece? (Set 1) Let us think carefully. Count 1 equal quarter pieces using the

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:13.960
language of parts. The answer is one-quarter. Great work!

